ransactional client\uff09 \u2014 sonic-mgmt-common \u306e translib\uff08gNMI GET/SET/SUBSCRIBE \u51e6\u7406\uff09\u306f\u5185\u90e8\u3067 \u5927\u91cf\u306e Redis client \u3092\u4f5c\u6210\u3057\u3001Redis TCP\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/redis-client-manager-rcm-hld.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:32:18+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T22:01:06+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:32:18+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6/", "title": "DHCP_SERVER_IPV6 \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "DHCP_SERVER_IPV6 \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 \u7d44\u307f\u8fbc\u307f DHCPv6 \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u6a5f\u80fd\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\uff082026-05 \u6642\u70b9\u3067\u672a\u5b9f\u88c5\u3002SONiC master \u306f DHCPv6 \u30ea\u30ec\u30fc\u306e\u307f\u5bfe\u5fdc\uff09\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:32:18+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-14T13:41:53+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/extended-monitor/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/extended-monitor/", "title": "\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8/\u30a2\u30e9\u30fc\u30e0\u62e1\u5f35\u76e3\u8996\u8a2d\u5b9a (extended-monitor)", "content_html": "eventd \u304c\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u3080 EVENT \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u4fdd\u6301\u4e0a\u9650 (eventd.json) \u3068\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\u30d7\u30ed\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb (/etc/evprofile/default.json) \u3092\u4e2d\u5fc3\u3068\u3057\u305f\u3001event/alarm framework \u306e\u62e1\u5f35\u76e3\u8996\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u3002CONFIG_DB \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3068\u3057\u3066\u7ba1\u7406\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/extended-monitor.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:32:18+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T02:04:48+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/sag/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/sag/", "title": "SAG \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "SAG \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 Static Anycast Gateway (SAG) \u306e\u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u4eee\u60f3 MAC \u30a2\u30c9\u30ec\u30b9\u3092\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b CONFIG_DB \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3002EVPN/VXLAN \u30d5\u30a1\u30d6\u30ea\u30c3\u30af\u5185\u3067\u5168 leaf switch \u304c\u540c\u4e00\u30b2\u30fc\u30c8\u30a6\u30a7\u30a4 IP/MAC \u3092\u5171\u6709\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u4f7f\u7528\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/sag.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:32:18+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-16T19:49:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/arp-entry-stuck/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/arp-entry-stuck/", "title": "ARP / Neighbor \u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u304c\u53e4\u3044 IP-MAC \u3092\u4fdd\u6301\u3057\u7d9a\u3051\u308b", "content_html": "Runbook: ARP \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u304c stale \u306a MAC \u3092\u8fd4\u3057\u7d9a\u3051\u3066 traffic \u304c\u9ed2\u7a74\u5316\u3059\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/arp-entry-stuck.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:32:18+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:34:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["arp", "neighbor", "runbook"]}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/bgp-graceful-restart-failure/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/bgp-graceful-restart-failure/", "title": "BGP Graceful Restart \u306e\u30cd\u30b4\u30b7\u30a8\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306b\u5931\u6557\u3059\u308b", "content_html": "Runbook: BGP Graceful Restart (GR) capability \u304c\u5bfe\u5411\u3068\u5408\u81f4\u305b\u305a restart \u6642\u306b\u7d4c\u8def\u65ad\u304c\u767a\u751f\u3059\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/bgp-graceful-restart-failure.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:32:18+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:34:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["bgp", "frr", "runbook"]}, {"